{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30014_01_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1a7dde54b91715e0f1a3d90d4a185a98349f3c05ca518850675614c247490412",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7213283c1803ed06a320d2d54ef5930ae1362ea3dad81cf1475c1d2461455226",
      "text": "你到底是在死命拼个什么劲啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bb7fe2195db8120954a6262ac7285539be20007ed9a5ac93a02eae0011361a6",
      "text": "虽然没办法解释得很清楚……\n但我只是受不了被人劈头盖脸说成那样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72f8e135a3d708caa8f59dfdf4780f38367abd528eabb3251eaeb8f7d48a335f",
      "text": "哈啊？你还在介意那群杂鱼吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27c7f54aee9b59038506388e1fb08c21970e176ab20189564ed1b4602e820c3e",
      "text": "没错。我想通过更多的训练，\n让他们收回那些话。仅此而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05326e566f8e9dedfbe7ade73a337782beab504fb3668a9702e049fa069b65d9",
      "text": "哼。因为小不点是个杂鱼嘛。\n不拼命的话就赶不上本大爷了是吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1100b10dccdae8177e7aab8cd267b373f1310ec70f6cd9345431254990a41f3",
      "text": "那你就尽管努力吧！库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4577c4cfecf7f2b7034175954a8ed943373c9917fd0fe5155c137b38f53c1a7",
      "text": "喂，拉面店的！\n本大爷肚子饿了。拿饭来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb593e1209b3bd1118b155c1ec6328feee8d0beec4a2dfb15af48562180bb3a9",
      "text": "这样啊。那去买点什么吧。\n武你也一起去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86ec84202a40a41ce17908eaf45576ff9ba90f731ef8e323c75c8b85ed9d4811",
      "text": "我不用了。比起那个，我想留下来加练。\n只要跟制作人拿到这里的使用许可……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0592972fa565c1566a3134258861b05a545e0c49946217c3001a2e82172fafb",
      "text": "啊，那件事的话没问题。我就猜到武会这么说，\n事先已经拜托过师父了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97ed04276233b6a748959680ab69b802fd934bee088f7e61982b355914b3f969",
      "text": "是这样吗。\n谢谢你，圆城寺先生。帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24d21d1cd68088a18e54fc75b684ce2fa9e46a3adc97c947a987bb0a6ca63708",
      "text": "哈哈，别客气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:489323e9cd860842056764d4ff642a6e95ea4911f4eb2857f8455a29a2cb7a17",
      "text": "我们待会儿也会再回来集合的。\n回头见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
